gine a city –exp 50\n–weird\t控制图像生成的「怪诞程度」\t0 到 3000\t/imagine a city –weird 100\n–chaos / –c\t控制生成随机性\t0 到 100\t/imagine a cat –chaos 50\n–niji\t启用动漫风格模型\t无需数值或 1-6\t/imagine an anime girl –niji 6\n–style\t选择风格变体：细化插画风格，可搭配 Niji\t例如 6a、6b\t/imagine an anime –style 6b\n(a：柔和动漫风；b：鲜明动漫风)\n–test\t启用测试模式 (实验性算法)：测试新算法效果\t无需数值\t/imagine a portrait –test\n–testp\t启用摄影风格测试模式：生成写实摄影风格图像\t无需数值\t/imagine a portrait –testp\n\n参考图像参数\n\n–sref\t指定风格参考图像\t图像 URL 或编码\t/imagine a dog –sref 3666203151\n–sw\t控制风格参考（–sref）影响程度\t0 到 1000\t/imagine a dog –sref 3666203151 –sw 500\n–cref\t指定角色参考图像\t图像 URL\t/imagine a wizard –cref elf.png\n–cw\t控制角色参考（–cref）影响程度\t0 到 100\t/imagine a wizard –cref elf.png –cw 75\n–oref\t指定全能参考图像：将特定元素融入新场景（角色、物体等）\t图像 URL\t/imagine a knight –oref sword.png\n–ow\t控制（–oref） 影响程度\t0 到 1000\t/imagine a knight –oref sword.png –ow 400\n–iw\t控制图像提示影响程度：调整图像与文字提示平衡\t0 到 2\t/imagine a city –iw 1.5\n\n其他进阶参数：适合专业用户或特定需求\n\n–no\t移除特定元素\t任意描述\t/imagine a landscape –no people\n–tile\t生成可平铺图像：设计纹理或壁纸\t无需数值\t/imagine a pattern –tile\n–seed\t指定种子值：重现特定图像风格\t0 到 4294967295\t/imagine a cat –seed 12345\n–video\t生成动画，展示生成过程\t无需数值\t/imagine a sunset –video\n–same\t保持一致性（实验性）\t无需数值\t/imagine a cat –same\n–hd\t提升解析度（V7 中不建议）\t无需数值\t/imagine a city –hd\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [788.2308959960938, 621.6865234375], "pos": [-83.36506652832031, 1370.7178955078125], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [22], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["9:16"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-217.73358154296875, 1071